{"abstract":[{"text":"Store a whole ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","type":"reference"},{"text":" on disk and load it again with the same entities, components and entity identifiers.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/savingandloadingscenes"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A nexus encodes as a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": every entity with its original identifier, the components conforming to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and the state of the entity identifier generator.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The snapshot works with any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" format, such as JSON, property lists or YAML.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Make-components-serializable","level":3,"text":"Make components serializable","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Conform each component you want to persist to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SerializableComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", or annotate it with ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Give each persisted type an explicit, stable name. The default name is the fully qualified Swift type name, which changes when you rename the type or its module:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["final class Position: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Position\"","    var x: Double","    var y: Double","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you rename a type later, list its former names, so existing scene files keep loading:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["final class Health: SerializableComponent {","    static let componentTypeName = \"Health\"","    static let componentTypeNameAliases = [\"HitPoints\"]","    var value: Int","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components referencing other entities can store an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Entity","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/EntityIdentifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Both are restored correctly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Save-and-load-a-nexus-with-Codable","level":3,"text":"Save and load a nexus with Codable","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so it can be part of your own scene type:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct Scene: Codable {","    var name: String","    var nexus: Nexus","}","","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(Scene(name: \"Level 1\", nexus: nexus))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes] = [Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self] as [any SerializableComponent.Type]","decoder.userInfo[.nexusEntityResolver] = EntityReferenceResolver(mapping: [:]) \/\/ needed for `Entity` properties","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Encoding throws ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentSerializationError\/notSerializable(typeName:)"},{"text":" for components that are not serializable.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To leave runtime-only components out instead, set ","type":"text"},{"code":"encoder.userInfo[.nexusNonSerializableComponentHandling]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NonSerializableComponentHandling\/skip"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding needs all component types of the scene in "},{"code":"userInfo[.nexusComponentTypes]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Unknown names throw "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentRegistryError\/unknownTypeName(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decoded nexus has the same entity identifiers and creates new entities with the identifiers the original nexus would have used next.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"text":"Load into an existing nexus","anchor":"Load-into-an-existing-nexus","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To keep a configured nexus, for example one with a delegate, families or a custom generator, use the snapshot API directly:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var encoder = JSONEncoder()","let data = try nexus.encodeSnapshot(using: &encoder, handling: .throwError)","","let restored = Nexus()","try restored.register([Position.self, Health.self, Parent.self])","var decoder = JSONDecoder()","try restored.restoreSnapshot(from: data, using: &decoder)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/restoreSnapshot(from:using:)"},{"text":" keeps the entity identifiers. It requires a nexus without entities and emits the usual entity and component events.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/decodeSnapshot(from:using:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" adds the snapshot as new entities to a populated nexus, for example for prefabs, and returns the mapping from saved to new identifiers."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both roll back all changes if decoding fails.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Use-other-formats","level":3,"text":"Use other formats","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The snapshot API accepts any coder conforming to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelEncoder","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/TopLevelDecoder","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyListEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and their decoders conform out of the box.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For other formats, add the conformance in your project. For example, with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/jpsim\/Yams","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Yams","","struct YAMLSceneEncoder: TopLevelEncoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func encode<T: Encodable>(_ value: T) throws -> String {","        try YAMLEncoder().encode(value, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}","","struct YAMLSceneDecoder: TopLevelDecoder {","    var userInfo: [CodingUserInfoKey: UserInfoValue] = [:]","    func decode<T: Decodable>(_ type: T.Type, from yaml: String) throws -> T {","        try YAMLDecoder().decode(type, from: yaml, userInfo: userInfo)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Nexus: Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" works with any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" coder directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For deterministic output, for example for scene files under version control, sort the keys, e.g. with ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder.OutputFormatting.sortedKeys","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"What-a-snapshot-contains","level":3,"text":"What a snapshot contains","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entity, including entities without components, with its original identifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every serializable component. A component instance shared by several entities is stored once and shared again after loading."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entity identifier generator state, if the generator conforms to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/PersistableEntityIdentifierGenerator","isActive":true},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" does.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not contained are components that are not serializable, families (they are derived from the components) and the nexus delegate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The format is versioned by ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusSnapshot\/formatVersion"},{"text":". Newer versions of FirebladeECS keep loading older snapshots and reject snapshots written by a newer version.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"role":"article","title":"Saving and Loading Scenes","roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/decodeSnapshot(from:using:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Decodes a snapshot into new entities of this nexus.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decodeSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SnapshotDecoder","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SnapshotDecoder","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS15TopLevelDecoderP5InputQa","text":"Input","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"using","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text